    "Adjust based on your dog's energy level and fitness.": {
      "comment": "Text explaining how to set the number of walks a day for an adult dog.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas aan op basis van het energieniveau en de conditie van je hond."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust based on your dog's energy level and fitness. The 5-minute rule applies to growing puppies.": {
      "comment": "Text explaining how to set the number of walks a day for an adult dog.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas aan op basis van het energieniveau en de conditie van je hond. De 5-minuten-regel geldt voor groeiende puppy's."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An estimate is fine. This helps tailor age-based guidance.": {
      "comment": "Subtitle under the \"Birth date\" question in the onboarding flow, explaining that an estimated birth date is acceptable and helps tailor age-based guidance.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een schatting is prima. Dit helpt om leeftijdsadvies af te stemmen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calling your dog for something unpleasant (bath, nail trim, end of play) - go get them instead": {
      "comment": "A mistake to avoid when practicing the 'come' skill, highlighting the importance of redirecting the dog when they're not responding.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je hond roepen voor iets onaangenaams (bad, nagels knippen, einde van het spelen) - haal ze in plaats daarvan op"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Chasing your dog when they don't come - this turns into a fun keep-away game for them": {
      "comment": "A mistake to avoid when training a puppy to come, emphasizing the negative impact of chasing.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je hond achtervolgen als ze niet komen - dit wordt een leuk tikkertje voor hen"
